    "facts": [
      "Both parents can guard the eggs and then the school of young, chasing off other fish and herding strays back.",
      "A brown bullhead can bury itself in mud to wait out bad conditions, and it tolerates low oxygen and high carbon dioxide.",
      "Its eyesight is poor; it finds food with eight barbels that sense touch and chemicals."
